  "body_text": "Let's Talk About Your Project\nContact us :\n        \n                    Send\n                \n        Schedule a meeting :\n        Do you have a project, an idea or a challenge involving genetics, environmental DNA (eDNA), population genomics or genomic selection?\nLet's schedule a free, no-obligation 15-minute consultation to discuss it\n This introductory meeting is an opportunity to:\n Briefly present your project, needs, or ideas.Explore how LDgenX's innovative genomic solutions can support your objectives.Ask your questions directly to one of LDgenX's founders and genomics experts.A simple conversation can be the first step toward a successful collaboration.15-Minute Free Consultation\n            info@ldgenx.fr\n        Station Ifremer,\n51 rte de Maguelone\n34250 Palavas-les-Flots\nFRANCE\n\nLet’s discuss your project\n        \n        Do you wish to implement biodiversity monitoring, study a population, or develop a specific molecular tool ?\n    \n                Contact our team",
